OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with lots of strong
OL,6,Fsunshine, temperatures rising rapidly
OL,7,Fduring the morning. High level cloud
OL,8,Fwill make the skies a little hazy
OL,9,Finitially just across Cumbria but
OL,10,Flater elsewhere. Feeling very warm and
OL,11,Flocally hot.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHigh level cloud will lead to
OL,14,Fa bright but hazy evening, with dry
OL,15,Fconditions persisting overnight. A few
OL,16,Fclear spells are likely, but another
OL,17,Fwarm night is likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
