OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,6,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,7,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light, but a
OL,8,Flittle brisker near western coasts.
OL,9,FFeeling very warm, locally hot.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,12,Fa fresher and cloudier from Friday
OL,13,Fwith perhaps the odd shower by
OL,14,FSaturday, and a spell of more
OL,15,Forganised rain may arrive late Sunday,
OL,16,Fas winds strengthen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
